WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.290
Homeroom guides: tracking your guard on contest day.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:10.650
On contest day, a Unit tracker button shows up on your family page. Tap it.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:20.900
It opens on the guard you're assigned to, and says how many steps you can tap. You can tap from thirty minutes before your shift until thirty minutes after.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:28.330
Your steps are the dark buttons. The grey ones belong to other crews, and fill in as they tap them.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:36.550
Tap a step when it happens. The coordinators see it on the live board right away. Tapped the wrong one? Tap Undo.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.195
When your guard leaves, tap Guard left the building.

00:00:40.395 --> 00:00:49.810
Once everything is out of the area, tap Homeroom clear. If a guard leaves with things left behind, the board turns red so someone can check.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:57.560
Questions or problems? Call or text your coordinator. They handle anything that needs a director.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:04.200
Thanks for guiding. Your coordinator is your first stop for anything on contest day.
